\details{
At each accumulation step k, the function computes:
\itemize{
\item \strong{Gamma}: Hill number of the pooled community (all k sites combined)
\item \strong{Alpha}: Generalized mean of per-site Hill numbers (Jost's power mean)
\item \strong{Beta}: gamma / alpha (effective number of distinct communities)
